tcome.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Multimedia and Animation Tools task. Identify the objective, describe the selected procedure and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the outcome against the objective, note one limitation or error source, and justify the choice.\n\nMarking guide: meaning/purpose 2; principles/steps 3; application/example 2; verification/conclusion 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** Raster/bitmap graphics use a grid of pixels and can lose apparent sharpness when enlarged beyond their available detail.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and relate it to Introduction to multimedia; vector graphics; Color channels; Bit depth. State relevant rules, components, assumptions or formulas and how they affect the outcome.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Multimedia and Animation Tools task. Identify the objective, describe the selected procedure and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the outcome against the objective, note one limitation or error source, and justify the choice.\n\nMarking guide: meaning/purpose 2; principles/steps 3; application/example 2; verification/conclusion 1."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

